      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“菱亚马逊”明明老是\n把全力对决挂在嘴边！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0fe84477605d77ca4c5e9635780e46fbfa8c2b972bade0c009178a942f6a6c5",
