    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14db2bddb45c863b478ac1ca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我这样……\n有什么资格妄想挑战“成田白仁”啊！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "39ae5f3144b1f9c92617b143aaefabb119db3adc6de4562104208920f1753639",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1012/storytimeline_501012113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        46,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/46/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34f5d3b2205e80dc80e0d8a2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看过比赛，\n我便知道她的状况有些异常。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da1a71ae63ad1cd130d9f2bc217a763244b138d0812da2c07e3c9109142d02f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1012/storytimeline_501012113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        47,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:492094f266475e18c8aa7c83",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是我等她冷静下来之后，\n仔细地问她发生了什么事──",
      "source_fingerprint": "55a0a663fea3b0713b0e36bb68fd7c709ffb9c100085c4a6530ec53740c2b2fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1012/storytimeline_501012113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e647d4b1b86d3d9923826211",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菱亚马逊",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e46e1b1d0b91c1ce1fa11c6823587aa41504c815d8da191f269c6fd336b6c12",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
