    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c729a11018c4405b9b3694ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──之前白仁跟会长的对决\n我一直忘不了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce81bedd7af64859ab412b4ec2ffd9bcd3651dc51aa09253b0ef5b11316028d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1012/storytimeline_501012113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        49,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/49/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e22518665a757e208599bcd1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菱亚马逊不经意地望向操场。\n看见两人在远处的草地赛道上疾奔而过。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab5029848183d5ab9fe8e908fbd19cfcad9230dea431a187b9fa503fbd970724",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1012/storytimeline_501012113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8d5a816e44a3b59618a6e94",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菱亚马逊",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e46e1b1d0b91c1ce1fa11c6823587aa41504c815d8da191f269c6fd336b6c12",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
