    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c66b92ada07b53ef5b0cdca0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在的我不管怎么做，\n都没有办法跟白仁摩擦出那种火花……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c274ce87bb44c590cd423edda1ac08315e2d4a3a9d6555cc90dc5dca077167c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1012/storytimeline_501012113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        52,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:489720e6c066360b4e21cca0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菱亚马逊紧握的拳头\n微弱地颤抖着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef138d2bc16c7f08eb07a8366553b4ad56198dcdab6f351b209f9d4db57d810e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1012/storytimeline_501012113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf430ba309c334359286bf56",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我不知道该安慰她还是鼓励她。\n当我拼命思考该说什么的时候──",
      "source_fingerprint": "500d7c770e4825b7070241dbe8cfcf2a35b0b0976e0551ca6c10fc9ce58980fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1012/storytimeline_501012113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        54,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe6a2c08048ee95928a69897",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菱亚马逊",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e46e1b1d0b91c1ce1fa11c6823587aa41504c815d8da191f269c6fd336b6c12",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1012/storytimeline_501012113.json",
      "json_path": [
