    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df98e63114606a3568395674",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──所以，我决定了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "06828a14e18e0fe21b62e5f768aff26d7f6d513df611b24dae8d584670f66918",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1012/storytimeline_501012113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        55,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/55/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7095b3269679b56b236afcfa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菱亚马逊径直地面向前方，\n那气势强得能够打散我的所有不安。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85f0af43e7a4922a2b2659833fb24c16e65502b66370b63cb2fe286051cfb177",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1012/storytimeline_501012113.json",
      "json_path": [
